{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "d319ad514aebc0eae52f641774cd42416538ae9e136b6ce7df5d900559396dde", "ja": "止まらない進化！！！！", "zh": "永不停歇的进化！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e6fb17ef448e2e94e6aade48de95aff5b64bcf9474dd1f2c401912985f24f397", "ja": "ダンスコラボは成功！　ダンス部の学生から\n近況の手紙が届く。好きなことに全力で取り\nくむ様子を知って喜ぶアイドル達。闘争心に\nも火がついたようで、抑えられない気持ちを\n全身で表現するのだった。", "zh": "舞蹈合作成功！舞蹈部的学生寄来了\n近况的信件。偶像们得知他们全力以赴\n投入自己喜欢的事情后，感到十分开心。\n似乎也被点燃了斗志，她们便用全身\n表达着难以抑制的情感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4ece877229202a3ef4f30a6373aaa379410f432cbde053ffdc1f8dcba4a053d5", "ja": "（ミラソニのダンスコラボは大成功！　その後、\n美楽留高校ダンス部の部員から手紙が届いた……）", "zh": "（米拉索尼的舞蹈合作大获成功！之后，美乐留高中舞蹈部的成员寄来了信……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "a7ad82c8601b7aba1283acc0fd52855475cd887ec5209b0f5d4a89fa1da870a3", "ja": "あのコラボがきっかけで、ダンス部の部員が\n増えたんだって！　他の部活の子も仮入部したりして！", "zh": "听说多亏了那次合作，舞蹈部的部员\n变多了呢！其他社团的人甚至也跑来临时入部了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "59cc4966386b188616dd9e5d0bf28a408e3218ef2b1a9b099e4f2b70e7ce91ec", "ja": "ははっ。ダンスを始める人が増えて、\nよかったじゃないか。", "zh": "哈哈。开始跳舞的人变多了，挺好的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "a30d699db34de3fdc949dee6a75dc829fe53d6d44eaec8a0063f9571dba91475", "ja": "ダンスコンテストの出場権をかけて、ダンス部の中で、\n対抗戦とかもするんだってね。面白そう～。", "zh": "听说舞蹈社还会为了争夺舞蹈比赛的参赛资格，在社团内部举办对抗赛之类的活动呢。感觉真有意思～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "f213c055b01ba618672fd5f50cf470d53608bc1b473a290560359fb282c5fb33", "ja": "エヘヘ。なんか、ワタシまで嬉しくなるヨー。\nダンスのおかげで、もっと仲良くなれたんだネ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，感觉连我都跟着开心起来了哦——\n多亏了舞蹈，大家变得更加要好了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "aab0f150ab046b26acf7eee1c75140fc544b310f2392457e4f7440514771cda8", "ja": "うん。もともとダンスってさ、きっとそういう\nコミュニケーションのためのものだと思うんだよね。", "zh": "嗯。舞蹈这种东西，本来就是为了进行那种交流的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "710c1efd820fec553f46790843989b40e252ebbff1f43f1fa1bbc47fec6da16e", "ja": "そうかもしれないな。ダンスが世界で楽しまれてるのも\n直感的に通じ合えるからだしな。", "zh": "或许真是这样。舞蹈之所以能在全世界广受欢迎，也是因为能够凭直觉相互理解吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "b64ca062597be5578f2b1f81367042e7876843d7bf34cad478e29b62e369ad5a", "ja": "でもさ～、なんかこういう、頑張ってる感じの手紙を\n読んだら、私たちも負けてられない～って思っちゃう！", "zh": "不过啊～读到这种充满努力劲头的信，就会让人觉得我们也不能输～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "f4c8150e9c43320b7e4afc43f4a30b4dfdcb22ff0765a10fd0601fdc9aab7b01", "ja": "うう～っ、とりあえず今から劇場の周り、\n走ってこようかな！？", "zh": "呜呜～，总之，我现在要不要先去剧场周围跑一圈！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "65010b3aeadddd074ef2aeb29dc0f9801e7c812d8b17c0ee7c07bc2f77437047", "ja": "ま、まあまあ。\nすぐに何かしたい気持ちはわかるが……。", "zh": "好、好了。  \n我明白你想马上做点什么的心情，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "c6c0430d75019d663c30e31c90ab822bf45c7b61e2ec064bc3fca6c17c902159", "ja": "いいね、海美！\nアタシも心の奥底からメラメラと……く～っ！", "zh": "太赞了，海美！\n我内心深处也燃起来了……呜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "c83fd0eafb7b110059afc4eb988c75119b462ee8882a3ac80b64c715343cc165", "ja": "ちょっと行ってくるねー、{$P$}！", "zh": "我去一下就回来——{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fdc2fb77882a1d099de2c05f6fe3b216aeb55aa5e5960a46eb3c28ab4f4dfc38", "ja": "あははっ。みんなのやる気に火が付いちゃったみたい。\nアタシは、また今度……。", "zh": "啊哈哈。看来大家的干劲都被点燃了。\n我下次再……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "be2c2f15c7b920fc457dde6f046e050db385af87c0275700f08701995519fa17", "ja": "アユムー！　仲間ハズレはよくないヨー？\nほらほら。一緒に外に行こう～♪", "zh": "步梦——！把人排除在外可不好哦？\n来嘛来嘛，一起出去吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "76515bcf75b99347b3bbdf653278b21e63096a70f17c7080f3c60093faedc8d3", "ja": "ええっ！？　仲間外れの意味、違わない？", "zh": "诶诶！？你说的“排除在外”，意思不一样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1016_p", "source_sha256": "450d8c54c89fc96b0b2dec111be26f34b653ee0974625c0c365881f23e41ec92", "ja": "逃げられないみたいだな？", "zh": "看来是逃不掉了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bbacd87871e2f244bcf9a01b995f1b4ab28990622910231710687a1c06cd1ea4", "ja": "……だね。\nはあ。アタシも行くよ！　みんな待って～！", "zh": "……是啊。\n唉，我也去！大家等等我～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b784f80a4a9808418511864c2c76b1106cac54f4a25845bc69f974f42e29b543", "ja": "みんな元気だな。\nさて、俺もみんなを見習って、仕事を片付けるか！", "zh": "大家真有精神啊。\n好了，我也向大家看齐，把工作处理完吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "1361a4496f28d69b0e0e6350bac690547cb671ca49e904eff543e538912ca477", "ja": "{$P$}、どうしたノ？\n逃げられないんだから～、早く一緒に行こうネ！", "zh": "{$P$}，怎么了呀？\n既然逃不掉～就快点和我一起走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194", "ja": "……えっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
